  "FLINK-28487": {
    "jira_id": "FLINK-28487",
    "issue_type": "New Feature",
    "resolution": "Done",
    "title": "Introduce configurable RateLimitingStrategy for Async Sink",
    "description": "Introduce a configurable RateLimitingStrategy to the AsyncSinkWriter.\r\n\r\nThis change will allow sink implementers using AsyncSinkWriter to configure their own RateLimitingStrategy instead of using the default AIMDRateLimitingStrategy.\r\n\r\nSee [FLIP-242: Introduce configurable RateLimitingStrategy for Async Sink|https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/FLINK/FLIP-242%3A+Introduce+configurable+RateLimitingStrategy+for+Async+Sink].\r\n\r\n ",
